  "title": "Astrid Moon Cattery",
  "description": "Apply to adopt a Ragdoll kitten from Astrid Moon Cattery. About five minutes; Astrid personally reviews every application and follows up with next steps. Not a reservation.",
  "sections": [
    {
      "key": "adoption-intro",
      "html": "<section aria-labelledby=\"adoption-application-heading\" class=\"bg-kar-cream py-12 sm:py-16\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-kar-gold-text sm:text-sm\">Kitten Adoption Application</p><h1 class=\"mt-4 font-serif text-3xl leading-tight text-kar-chocolate sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl\" id=\"adoption-application-heading\">Kitten Adoption Process</h1><p class=\"mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-kar-chocolate-soft sm:text-lg\">About five minutes. Tell Astrid a little about your home and what you're looking for, and she will personally follow up with next steps.</p><p class=\"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl rounded-xl border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory px-4 py-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-kar-chocolate\">Submitting an application does not reserve a kitten and does not guarantee approval. Astrid reads every application herself.</p></div></div></section>"
    },
    {
      "key": "adoption-steps",
      "html": "<section aria-labelledby=\"adoption-process-heading\" class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-kar-blush-pale py-14 sm:py-16 lg:py-20\"><img alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover opacity-[0.14] saturate-[0.7]\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2000\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kittenaroundragdolls.com/images/background/10.jpg\" width=\"2000\"/><div class=\"container relative\"><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-4\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-4 w-10 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8E3FA8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 40 16\"><path d=\"M2 8h16\"></path><path d=\"M20 8c4-4 8-6 12-6-2 4-6 6-12 6Z\"></path><path d=\"M20 8c4 4 8 6 12 6-2-4-6-6-12-6Z\"></path></svg><h2 class=\"font-serif text-3xl text-kar-chocolate sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl\" id=\"adoption-process-heading\">Kitten Adoption Process</h2><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-4 w-10 shrink-0 scale-x-[-1]\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8E3FA8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 40 16\"><path d=\"M2 8h16\"></path><path d=\"M20 8c4-4 8-6 12-6-2 4-6 6-12 6Z\"></path><path d=\"M20 8c4 4 8 6 12 6-2-4-6-6-12-6Z\"></path></svg></div></div><ul class=\"mt-10 grid list-none gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><li class=\"flex h-full flex-col rounded-[20px] border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory p-5 text-center shadow-kar-soft motion-safe:transition motion-safe:duration-300 hover:shadow-kar-card\"><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl\"><img alt=\"Submit a Kitten Application\" class=\"object-cover\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kittenaroundragdolls.com/images/process/1.jpeg\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;\"/></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute -left-2 -top-2 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-accent font-londrinaSolid text-xl text-kar-dark shadow-kar-soft\">1</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-6 mb-3 font-serif text-2xl text-kar-chocolate\">Submit a Kitten Application</h3><p class=\"mb-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-kar-chocolate-soft\">To be considered for adoption, all prospective families must complete a Kitten Application. We review each application carefully to ensure our kittens go to loving forever homes.</p><div class=\"mt-auto\"></div></li><li class=\"flex h-full flex-col rounded-[20px] border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory p-5 text-center shadow-kar-soft motion-safe:transition motion-safe:duration-300 hover:shadow-kar-card\"><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl\"><img alt=\"Buffy, a Ragdoll kitten resting in a basket at Astrid Moon Cattery\" class=\"object-contain bg-kar-cream\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kittenaroundragdolls.com/images/process/buffy-real.jpg\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;\"/></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute -left-2 -top-2 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-accent font-londrinaSolid text-xl text-kar-dark shadow-kar-soft\">2</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-6 mb-3 font-serif text-2xl text-kar-chocolate\">Reserve Your Kitten</h3><p class=\"mb-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-kar-chocolate-soft\">Our kittens are <strong class=\"font-semibold text-kar-chocolate\">$4,500</strong>. If your application is approved, you'll get access to our available kittens and can place a <strong class=\"font-semibold text-kar-chocolate\">$1,000 deposit</strong> to reserve yours — the deposit applies toward the total, with the $3,500 balance due before pickup.</p><div class=\"mt-auto\"><a class=\"inline-flex w-full\" href=\"/available-kittens\"><span class=\"group/button relative hover:animate-jumpeffect font-londrinaSolid inline-flex tracking-wide items-center justify-center duration-300 font-bold rounded-xl transition-all focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 before:absolute before:bottom-[-15px] before:w-[calc(100%/2)] before:h-[5px] before:left-[45%] before:rounded-[100%] before:blur-[2px] before:bg-[rgba(16,41,55,0.1)] before:-translate-x-1/2 before:transition-all before:duration-300 rounded-kar border border-kar-gold bg-kar-chocolate text-kar-ivory-bright shadow-kar-btn hover:bg-kar-chocolate-soft hover:animate-none focus-visible:ring-kar-gold ring-offset-kar-ivory px-8 py-3.5 w-full whitespace-normal before:!hidden after:!hidden\"><span class=\"z-[1] flex gap-2 items-center mt-0\">View Available Kittens <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></span></a></div></li><li class=\"flex h-full flex-col rounded-[20px] border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory p-5 text-center shadow-kar-soft motion-safe:transition motion-safe:duration-300 hover:shadow-kar-card\"><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl\"><img alt=\"Giles, a Ragdoll kitten resting in a basket at Astrid Moon Cattery\" class=\"object-contain bg-kar-cream\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kittenaroundragdolls.com/images/process/giles-real.jpg\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;\"/></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute -left-2 -top-2 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-accent font-londrinaSolid text-xl text-kar-dark shadow-kar-soft\">3</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-6 mb-3 font-serif text-2xl text-kar-chocolate\">Stay in the Loop</h3><p class=\"mb-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-kar-chocolate-soft\">Once your application is approved, stay connected every step of the way. Follow us on social media, subscribe to our blog for breed tips and cattery updates, or join our newsletter for kitten availability alerts straight to your inbox.</p><div class=\"mt-auto\"></div></li></ul><p class=\"mt-8 text-center text-sm text-kar-chocolate-soft\">Deposits are non-refundable, and apply toward the total. <a class=\"text-kar-rose underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-kar-chocolate\" href=\"/adoption-process\">See pricing, payment and go-home details</a>.</p></div></section>"
    },
    {
      "key": "adoption-information",
      "html": "<div class=\"adoption-information\"><div class=\"adoption-information-inner\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold\">Apply to Adopt a Kitten</h2><p>Finding the right match matters to us. Tell us a little about what you're looking for, and Astrid will personally follow up to answer your questions and discuss the kittens who may fit your family.</p><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-xl font-semibold\">What happens next</h3><ol class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex h-7 w-7 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-kar-chocolate font-londrinaSolid text-sm text-kar-ivory-bright\">1</span><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-kar-chocolate-soft\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-kar-chocolate\">Apply for a kitten.</span> The first step; about five minutes, no deposit, no commitment.</p></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex h-7 w-7 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-kar-chocolate font-londrinaSolid text-sm text-kar-ivory-bright\">2</span><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-kar-chocolate-soft\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-kar-chocolate\">Astrid reviews.</span> Approval is about your home and family, not a specific kitten.</p></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex h-7 w-7 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-kar-chocolate font-londrinaSolid text-sm text-kar-ivory-bright\">3</span><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-kar-chocolate-soft\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-kar-chocolate\">Reserve your spot in line.</span> Once approved, place the $1,000 non-refundable fee toward the $4,500 total.</p></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex h-7 w-7 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-kar-chocolate font-londrinaSolid text-sm text-kar-ivory-bright\">4</span><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-kar-chocolate-soft\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-kar-chocolate\">Meet, choose, and match.</span> Visit in person to meet the kittens, and Astrid can help match you with a kitten from a current or upcoming litter. Not local? Astrid can show you the kittens over a video call, or match you by the color, temperament, and personality you’re hoping for.</p></li></ol><p class=\"mt-2 border-t border-kar-champagne pt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-kar-chocolate\">Our companion kittens are $4,500, with a $1,000 non-refundable reservation fee applied toward the total. The $3,500 balance is due before pickup.</p><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-xl font-semibold\">Every kitten goes home with</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex gap-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-kar-chocolate-soft\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-kar-gold-text\">•</span><span>Spay or neuter completed before go-home</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-kar-chocolate-soft\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-kar-gold-text\">•</span><span>Microchip</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-kar-chocolate-soft\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-kar-gold-text\">•</span><span>Age-appropriate vaccinations</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-kar-chocolate-soft\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-kar-gold-text\">•</span><span>TICA registration</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-kar-chocolate-soft\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-kar-gold-text\">•</span><span>30 days of Trupanion coverage</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-kar-chocolate-soft\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-kar-gold-text\">•</span><span>Professional photos of your kitten</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-kar-chocolate-soft\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-kar-gold-text\">•</span><span>Food samples, toys, and a box of cat litter</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-kar-chocolate-soft\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-kar-gold-text\">•</span><span>Lifetime breeder support</span></li></ul><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-kar-chocolate-soft\">A small, in-home cattery raising only a limited number of kittens each year. DNA-Tested Breeding Cats. Healthy, happy, well-socialized kittens.</p><ul class=\"mt-2 space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex gap-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-kar-chocolate-soft\"><span class=\"text-kar-gold-text\">✔</span><span>Detailed answers help Astrid understand your home and find the right match.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-kar-chocolate-soft\"><span class=\"text-kar-gold-text\">✔</span><span>Add astridmooncattery@gmail.com to your safe senders so her reply reaches you.</span></li></ul></div></div>"
    }
